%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DialogueLoc_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 642070058e751ba448ff8e623a79c71b, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 57487491264512
    m_Localized: Good evening, thank you for choosing to work for "STYXYZ" transportation
      company.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487591927808
    m_Localized: O.A.R.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122112
    m_Localized: I see that it's your first day at work! I'm your AI assistant O.A.R.
      and I'm gonna help you do the job to its fullest potential.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122113
    m_Localized: As you might be aware, in "STYXYZ" we not only care for our passengers
      safe drive to their destination.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122114
    m_Localized: But we also try to make the passenger as comfortable as possible!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122115
    m_Localized: For that you will need to create a correct atmosphere, depending
      on how they feel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122116
    m_Localized: Oh, I think your first customer is about to arrive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122117
    m_Localized: Okay, act natural, and try to listen to them, to better understand
      how they feel, good luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122118
    m_Localized: Good evening...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122119
    m_Localized: Vanessa
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122120
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122121
    m_Localized: Deep talk you two are having I see... Well, of course, you have
      not created any mood for our lovely passenger yet!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122122
    m_Localized: 'For that, a couple of things need to be done.

      Firstly let''s
      turn on the radio.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122123
    m_Localized: To do that you just have to look at it hard enough!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122124
    m_Localized: After, try to find something relaxing. Our passenger looks like
      she is in some kind of distress...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122125
    m_Localized: 'To change the station, the only thing you need to do is rotate
      the dial!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122126
    m_Localized: 'Nice! This should work just fine.

      Okay, another thing that
      we need to do, is to set up a correct light.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122127
    m_Localized: You can find the controller for the car light on the top, near the
      rearview mirror.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122128
    m_Localized: To make the lights blue, just click on the blue button a bunch of
      times, it's that simple!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122129
    m_Localized: I like the color blue a lot, and I think our passenger will like
      it as well!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122130
    m_Localized: Colors can also be combined, but for now let's stick to the simple
      stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122131
    m_Localized: 'Amazing, you''re a natural at this!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122132
    m_Localized: 'To know if the atmospehere you''re creating is suiatable for the
      passenger, you can always rely on the SYNCHRONIZER.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122133
    m_Localized: 'It will tell you how close you are to make the passenger open up
      to you.

      I know it might be hard at first, but you got this!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122134
    m_Localized: 'The more your passenger will speak up about themselves, the better
      their review about you will be!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122135
    m_Localized: Also, one last thing. The first atmosphere that comes to your mind,
      might not always be the best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122136
    m_Localized: Think of yourself as a psychologist in a sense!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122137
    m_Localized: But do it enough times, and they might be overwhelmed, and will
      not want to continue their talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122138
    m_Localized: 'I think the passenger is about to open up!

      Okay, good luck!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122139
    m_Localized: Some passengers open up only if you push them towards a specific
      emotion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122140
    m_Localized: Do you like your job?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122141
    m_Localized: Sorry, that came out weird. I just don't get how you can be okay
      with random people getting in your car every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122142
    m_Localized: Drunk jerks you have to clean up after.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122143
    m_Localized: Talking to strangers, trying not to be rude just so they don't leave
      you a bad review.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122144
    m_Localized: I could never handle that many small talks in a day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122145
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122146
    m_Localized: 'Good job! I hope you figured out how the SYNCHRONIZER works.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122147
    m_Localized: 'Be carefull next time though, people usually can wait for around
      23 seconds before they lose their thought.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122148
    m_Localized: So if you're not gonna be able to find the right atmosphere for
      them, they will not bother continuing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122149
    m_Localized: 'Okay, sorry. Time to work!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122150
    m_Localized: 'Good job! I hope you figured out how the SYNCHRONIZER works.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122151
    m_Localized: 'Be carefull next time though, people usually can wait for around
      23 seconds before they lose their thought.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122152
    m_Localized: So if you're not gonna be able to find the right atmosphere for
      them, they will not bother continuing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122153
    m_Localized: 'Okay, sorry. Time to work!

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122154
    m_Localized: 'Actually... maybe that''s not fair to them.

      It more of a
      "me" problem than those people problem.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122155
    m_Localized: Every time someone talks to me, I'm already grading myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122156
    m_Localized: What I said. How I said it. Whether my face did something weird.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122157
    m_Localized: By the end I've given myself, like, a two out of ten. Every time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122158
    m_Localized: So I just don't bother talking. No review is better than a bad one,
      right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122159
    m_Localized: I'm honestly surprised I even iniated this talk with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122160
    m_Localized: One...friend...told me that being around me is exhausting because
      of this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122161
    m_Localized: He was probably right. He usually was.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122162
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122163
    m_Localized: 'You know what? No. Why am I always the exhausting one?



'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122164
    m_Localized: 'How...

      ...Nevermind, it''s a stupid question.

      ...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122165
    m_Localized: My "parents" are never home. Never.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122166
    m_Localized: And when they are, it's "why do you look so tired, you didn't even
      do anything today.".
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122167
    m_Localized: I look tired because I raised your kid for you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122168
    m_Localized: And even then you don't even care in slightest about how I feel,
      because I am never enough for them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122169
    m_Localized: 'UGH...

      ...Sorry. I don''t usually yell in taxis.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122170
    m_Localized: '...Sorry. I don''t usually yell in taxis.

      It''s just a lot
      of stuff is in my head right now.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122171
    m_Localized: ...Me and that friend I was talking about broke up today. And...
      I don't know, nothing makes sense anymore without him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122172
    m_Localized: '...

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122173
    m_Localized: 'I just, don''t know where to go from here.

      That friend I
      was talking about...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122174
    m_Localized: 'We broke up today.

      And I don''t know how to feel about it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122175
    m_Localized: If I knew beforehand that this would happened, maybe at least I
      could prepare myself better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122176
    m_Localized: But it all came so suddently... We were just going to the cinema
      the other day, and now, can I even talk to him?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122177
    m_Localized: 'Because if that''s the case...

      ...Guess we''ll see.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122178
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122179
    m_Localized: 'Jezz... I hope I didn''t say too much.

      Judging by your reaction
      you don''t mind me though.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122180
    m_Localized: 'But still, sorry for trauma dumping.

      I really shouldn''t
      be telling this much to a stranger.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122181
    m_Localized: 'But I guess you know about me more than some of my "friends".

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122182
    m_Localized: 'Egh...

      Anyways, what has been said, was said.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122183
    m_Localized: 'For some reason I do not mind sharing this with you.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122184
    m_Localized: 'Oh, is it my stop already?

      Thank you for the ride, and please,
      if you can. Can you keep what I said between us?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122185
    m_Localized: I'll leave a good review, I know you care about those!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122186
    m_Localized: Please, can you keep what I said between us. I am not comfortable
      with others knowing about this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122187
    m_Localized: ...Thank you for the ride.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122188
    m_Localized: 'Maybe if I''d just said what I wanted, for once...

      No. That''s...
      just makes it worse.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122189
    m_Localized: 'Oh, is this my stop?

      I don''t really... uh... nothing.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122190
    m_Localized: Thanks. I will leave a review, I guess. That's how it works, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122191
    m_Localized: Actually, thinking about it. Maybe it's not as bad as I described
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122192
    m_Localized: It's kind of like grabbing a random book off a library shelf, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122193
    m_Localized: You don't search for it. You don't even read the back. You just
      open it, and someone's whole life is in there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122194
    m_Localized: A drunk jerk on page one. Maybe something beautiful on page forty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122195
    m_Localized: 'I''d probably be one of those books nobody finishes.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122196
    m_Localized: Ha. Sorry. That was a three out of ten joke.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122197
    m_Localized: '...

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122198
    m_Localized: 'I should buy new books to read.

      Or to collect dust, like
      most of the time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122199
    m_Localized: 'Honestly? I think I''m scared of being read.

      I know that
      it''s not only me who has stupid thoughts about other people.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122200
    m_Localized: But someone reading those thoughts, even thinking about it already
      makes me feel uneasy...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122201
    m_Localized: 'My little sister wouldn''t care that much about this.

      She
      talks to everyone. Bus drivers. Cashiers. The neighbor''s dog.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122202
    m_Localized: 'She seems to be making friends every miniute.

      I don''t know
      from where she got that.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122203
    m_Localized: Even though I was the one who taught her to read. Me and her seem
      to be total opposites
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122204
    m_Localized: Funny. I gave her all of my books and didn't keep any for myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122205
    m_Localized: '...it is not an analogy for reading the random books.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122206
    m_Localized: ...at least I think it isn't...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122207
    m_Localized: Saying all of this out loud makes me sound like I'm jelous of her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122208
    m_Localized: 'Maybe it''s kinda true. Ha. Don''t tell her.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122209
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122210
    m_Localized: 'Although there was a person who did read me to the end.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122211
    m_Localized: 'He did not like the ending... But I hope at least he enjoyed the
      start.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122212
    m_Localized: I'm talking about my boyf...ex-boyfriend... now. Damn, it feels
      so bad to say it like that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122213
    m_Localized: Like, he could understand me, you know? He didn't label me as anything,
      or pushed me too hard to change myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122214
    m_Localized: 'I appreciate him for that.

      A lot...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122215
    m_Localized: Even though he is the one who initiated the breakup. I can't bring
      myself to blame him still.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122216
    m_Localized: '...

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122217
    m_Localized: 'It''s funny how I ended up talking about all of this just because
      I don''t like smelly people in cars.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122218
    m_Localized: 'Well, anyways.

      I think we are close to my stop.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122219
    m_Localized: 'Thank you for the ride, and goodbye.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122220
    m_Localized: Thank you for listening to me... I am surprised I was able to get
      this off my chest so easily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122221
    m_Localized: I didn't think that a taxi drive would turn into a therapy session,
      but I guess we are here now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122222
    m_Localized: 'I would also like to listen to you talk even a bit you know, haha.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122223
    m_Localized: But it's okay, maybe next time if you're still gonna be working
      here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122224
    m_Localized: 'Either way, I believe we are close to my stop.

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122225
    m_Localized: Thank you again, have a good rest of the night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122226
    m_Localized: To interact with objects you can press "E" on keyboard or LMB.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 57487596122227
    m_Localized: To stop interacting with objects press "Q" on keyboard or RMB.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
